title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/George_Jones_Speech.jpg

# go-to syntax: go-to: main_rally; ful_disrupt if ful_strength > 180 and not ful_banned and not return_to_normalcy

Mass rallies are a common feature of social democratic life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @rally_commonwealth: Spread the ideals of a Cooperative Commonwealth 
- @welfare: Agitate for a stronger relief program in the face of the Drought and Economic Crisis
- @blame_old_line: Blame the old-line parties for doing nothing
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @wtb: Support the WTB plan!
- @local: A mixture of various local and provincial concerns that resonate most with our audience.
- @easy_discard

@rally_commonwealth
on-arrival: workers_ccf += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if radical_strength > managerial_strength; workers_ccf += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; radical_strength += 5; radical_dissent -= 5; old_middle_ccf -= 3; new_middle_ccf -= 2;

Spreading the gospel of a true Cooperative Commonwealth increases general support for Socialism, both among farmers and worker alike. 

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); workers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ccf += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; managerial_strength += 3; managerial_dissent -= 3; labour_dissent -= 3;

Speaking of a strong welfare state certainly inspires the workers and farmers who have been downtrodden by the lack of an adequate relief program. 

@blame_old_line
on-arrival: workers_cps -= 2; workers_lps -= 2; farmers_cps -= 2; farmers_lps -= 2; new_middle_cps -= 2; new_middle_lps -= 2; cps_relation -= 5

Blaming the old parties increases support for new parties like ours. 

@pacifism
view-if: year >= 1939 and year <= 1945
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_ccf += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; new_middle_ccf += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

Our speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
on-arrival: wtb_support += 1; workers_ccf += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf += 6*(1-dissent); farmers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ccf += 3*(1-dissent);

The WTB plan has become a popular rallying cry for our party. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises.


@local
on-arrival: workers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ccf += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the people in this moment. 
